# promise: #701
# On chrome://extensions/shortcuts a shortcut is recorded by pressing it, so Cra holds extensions'
# shortcuts back there, as Chrome does: ⌥⇧Y doesn't open the fixture's popup while that page is in front.
budget rss=900 stalls50=20
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true, "showToolbar": true}
cra://debug?installExtension=${FIXTURES}/CommandsExtension
relaunch
cra://debug?windowSize=1200x800
cra://open?url=chrome://extensions/shortcuts
wait 3
cra://debug?key=Y,16,655360
wait 2
reject-log extension command [a-p]{8}: opens its popup
